1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
I'd have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know....

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
I'll blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As I make foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
Im bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback the time to awaken is now

20
00:01:36,174 --> 00:01:40,913
Good to know you've still got
that cocky side to ya, Straw Hat!

21
00:01:41,521 --> 00:01:48,304
When your mind and body catch up to your power,
that's when Awakening happens!

22
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:52,434
And your power's
just plain ridiculous...

23
00:01:53,043 --> 00:01:55,869
I've already lost so much...

24
00:01:55,869 --> 00:02:00,565
So much of the empire I built, gone!

25
00:02:00,957 --> 00:02:03,565
My underlings, and the castle!

26
00:02:03,608 --> 00:02:04,999
Same goes for you, don't it?

27
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,522
True, but I've got stuff
I gotta take back from ya!

28
00:02:14,347 --> 00:02:17,651
Kundali Dragon Swarm!

29
00:02:27,347 --> 00:02:29,260
Ya big dope!

30
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,652
Howzzat for ya!!

31
00:03:04,565 --> 00:03:09,260
Every floor of the castle
below us is on fire.

32
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:14,217
Pretty sure thousands of
your soldiers are stuck there, too.

33
00:03:14,652 --> 00:03:16,652
And they're all gonna
roast to death!

34
00:03:18,521 --> 00:03:20,912
Don't sell 'em short, Kaido!

35
00:03:21,869 --> 00:03:26,130
I trusted 'em to take care of everything
goin' on down there for me!

36
00:03:26,130 --> 00:03:28,130
And I did that so I could...

37
00:03:28,174 --> 00:03:30,521
...focus on kickin' your ass sky-high!

38
00:03:39,217 --> 00:03:41,826
The way you laugh pisses me off!

39
00:03:41,826 --> 00:03:43,912
Demolition Gust!

40
00:03:56,347 --> 00:04:00,477
It's not just the castle anymore!
All the towers are burning!

41
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:03,391
Guyyyys!

42
00:04:03,391 --> 00:04:05,913
Where'd everybody go?!

43
00:04:05,913 --> 00:04:08,086
Where are you all?!

44
00:04:08,086 --> 00:04:09,999
Heeeey!

45
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,087
Chopper!

46
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,478
Nami!

47
00:04:13,478 --> 00:04:14,782
You all right?!

48
00:04:16,696 --> 00:04:19,739
What do we do?!
We can't put out the fire!

49
00:04:19,739 --> 00:04:22,869
Zoro, Sanji, Franky, Brook,

50
00:04:23,304 --> 00:04:26,086
Usopp, Robin, and Jinbe...

51
00:04:26,086 --> 00:04:27,434
I haven't found any of them!

52
00:04:27,435 --> 00:04:29,478
They might be stuck in the fire!

53
00:04:29,478 --> 00:04:31,217
Really?!

54
00:04:32,913 --> 00:04:33,609
But...

55
00:04:34,391 --> 00:04:38,869
Even if we went searching,
all of Onigashima's in flames!

56
00:04:39,435 --> 00:04:41,217
Here isn't safe, either!

57
00:04:41,217 --> 00:04:45,000
Unless the island lands,
we've got nowhere to go!

58
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:49,825
Zeus, can't you use your rain
to put out the fire?

59
00:04:49,826 --> 00:04:53,434
In a fire like this?!
I'd be baked crispy!

60
00:04:53,435 --> 00:04:56,347
We all worked so hard
to get this far!

61
00:04:56,347 --> 00:04:59,477
How could it end like this?

62
00:04:59,478 --> 00:05:00,521
Don't worry!

63
00:05:00,521 --> 00:05:01,347
Huh?

64
00:05:01,347 --> 00:05:05,434
It's all gonna be totally okay,
so no giving up!

65
00:05:11,957 --> 00:05:15,000
We can't escape!
The fire's everywhere!

66
00:05:16,565 --> 00:05:18,130
There's nowhere to run!

67
00:05:18,217 --> 00:05:21,043
Dammit all!

68
00:05:23,174 --> 00:05:25,130
I can't take it anymore!

69
00:05:25,174 --> 00:05:27,869
I'm not made for this heat!

70
00:05:30,565 --> 00:05:33,086
It's way too much work
to lug you around, Bepo!

71
00:05:38,826 --> 00:05:39,869
Yeooow!

72
00:05:40,739 --> 00:05:42,739
Maybe this is the end...

73
00:05:43,217 --> 00:05:45,434
I don't think we can
get out of this one!

74
00:05:45,435 --> 00:05:49,348
Save us, Captaaaain!

75
00:05:58,217 --> 00:06:01,347
My precious afro is becoming
more curly by the moment!

76
00:06:01,347 --> 00:06:02,608
That it is...

77
00:06:02,608 --> 00:06:04,738
I'd prefer to not end up
looking like you, Brook.

78
00:06:04,739 --> 00:06:05,261
Eh?

79
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,521
Huuuh?!

80
00:06:12,521 --> 00:06:14,478
A skeleton!

81
00:06:14,478 --> 00:06:17,130
I feel your frustration!

82
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:21,652
To be reduced to that state...
I don't know what to say!

83
00:06:21,652 --> 00:06:23,304
My condolences to you...

84
00:06:23,304 --> 00:06:26,173
You must have been slow in escaping
and burned to a crisp!

85
00:06:26,174 --> 00:06:28,869
Come now,
I am no charred corpse!

86
00:06:28,869 --> 00:06:30,260
I am dead though...

87
00:06:34,086 --> 00:06:37,303
My goodness,
is the burning ever intense!

88
00:06:37,304 --> 00:06:39,999
Perhaps there isn't a way
for all of us to escape, after all...

89
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,609
Perhaps not...

90
00:06:55,347 --> 00:06:56,477
No go...

91
00:06:56,478 --> 00:06:59,217
We can't escape from here
with the courtyard gone.

92
00:06:59,217 --> 00:07:00,652
Oh, no!

93
00:07:00,652 --> 00:07:02,956
The abyss to our front,

94
00:07:02,957 --> 00:07:05,087
and hell's at our backs...

95
00:07:09,174 --> 00:07:12,782
Can't even turn around
and head back, huh...

96
00:07:16,739 --> 00:07:19,478
Nowhere to run
while we're midair...

97
00:07:19,478 --> 00:07:22,087
The fire, the collapsing castle,
and the ladies...

98
00:07:23,217 --> 00:07:25,347
Well, what to do then...

99
00:07:31,739 --> 00:07:35,043
I don't wanna hear, "It's hot!"
Bust down the damn wall!

100
00:07:35,086 --> 00:07:36,869
Unless you'd rather die here!

101
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:39,738
Just sacrifice one of your damn arms!

102
00:07:40,608 --> 00:07:43,738
What use is that huge body
of yours anyway, dumbass?!

103
00:07:45,608 --> 00:07:48,173
Wanna fight, do ya,
you moron?!

104
00:07:56,304 --> 00:07:58,999
The heat and the flames
have put us in a pickle!

105
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,391
Is there a way for us to survive?!

106
00:08:01,435 --> 00:08:04,695
If we had a clue,
this wouldn't be an issue!

107
00:08:04,739 --> 00:08:07,304
The heat will kill us
if we can't find a solution!

108
00:08:07,347 --> 00:08:09,086
Just keep running!

109
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,522
Please, do something, sir!

110
00:08:27,478 --> 00:08:30,261
I'm gonna put out this fire, then!

111
00:08:30,347 --> 00:08:32,304
Sure-Kill Green Star:

112
00:08:32,652 --> 00:08:34,217
Sprinkler!

113
00:08:39,957 --> 00:08:43,304
This is the very definition of
"a drop in the bucket," my good man!

114
00:08:43,304 --> 00:08:48,130
Shaddap! I gotta figure something out!
I promised Izo, dammit!

115
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:51,434
Iwanna save Kin and Kiku...
and myself, too!

116
00:08:51,435 --> 00:08:52,913
Hueh?!

117
00:08:52,957 --> 00:08:55,913
Sir, please include me as well!

118
00:08:57,565 --> 00:09:00,434
The castle's burnin' outta control!

119
00:09:00,826 --> 00:09:02,260
Which way do we go?!

120
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:04,738
Zoro's hangin' by a thread!

121
00:09:04,739 --> 00:09:07,652
Gotta get him to Chopper ASAP!

122
00:09:07,739 --> 00:09:11,043
We're all gonna be cooked
before that happens!

123
00:09:11,086 --> 00:09:15,129
So hot, so hot!
I just wanna survive!

124
00:09:15,217 --> 00:09:17,869
Help us, Big Bro!

125
00:09:17,869 --> 00:09:21,260
Who's whinin' back there?!

126
00:09:21,304 --> 00:09:22,651
Don't make me
set ya on fire!

127
00:09:22,696 --> 00:09:25,261
Please don't!

128
00:09:27,782 --> 00:09:30,999
Another dead end! Dammit!

129
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,435
Flames and debris
keep getting in our way!

130
00:09:33,435 --> 00:09:35,913
Did someone run around
setting these fires?!

131
00:09:38,435 --> 00:09:43,087
Death by fire rather than by the hand of the enemy
is not the way I plan on going down in this raid!

132
00:09:44,347 --> 00:09:45,825
Some fight this turned out to be...

133
00:09:47,739 --> 00:09:50,913
We're not gonna let
some fire get us!

134
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,782
Yeah! We're making it through this!

135
00:09:53,782 --> 00:09:56,434
Aye!

136
00:10:03,391 --> 00:10:07,304
I am prepared, Jinbe-dono!

137
00:10:07,304 --> 00:10:11,434
I am grateful for your trust in me!

138
00:10:11,435 --> 00:10:15,000
Luffy chose to ally
with you and yours, Samurai!

139
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,957
What place has doubt here?

140
00:10:16,957 --> 00:10:19,086
Come, do what you must!

141
00:10:19,086 --> 00:10:23,738
I shall! If anything,
I am the one placing my trust in you!

142
00:10:24,826 --> 00:10:28,391
Ever since that day,
I have been prepared...

143
00:10:31,304 --> 00:10:32,390
Toki-sama!

144
00:10:32,391 --> 00:10:34,478
Momonosuke-sama!

145
00:10:34,478 --> 00:10:36,174
Hiyori-sama!

146
00:10:38,478 --> 00:10:40,956
Make haste!
Haste, I say!

147
00:10:44,478 --> 00:10:47,565
I could not defend Oden-sama that day...

148
00:10:47,565 --> 00:10:52,043
I allowed Momonosuke-sama
and the others to suffer in that inferno of a castle!

149
00:10:52,043 --> 00:10:55,129
Even with my Ninja Arts,
could not save anybody then!

150
00:10:55,174 --> 00:10:57,087
A great blunder
for which I must repent!

151
00:10:58,565 --> 00:11:00,173
I never, ever want...

152
00:11:00,174 --> 00:11:03,608
...to feel that way again!

153
00:11:07,696 --> 00:11:09,000
Tis Zou?!

154
00:11:24,347 --> 00:11:26,390
Inuarashi, what manner of rain is this?!

155
00:11:26,957 --> 00:11:28,913
Zunesha is bathing itself.

156
00:11:28,913 --> 00:11:32,783
What an incredible amount of water!
May I partake?

157
00:11:35,826 --> 00:11:40,260
will not permit those that
took part in this raid...

158
00:11:40,304 --> 00:11:41,956
to die to these accursed flames!

159
00:11:41,957 --> 00:11:44,826
I have kept you waiting
for too long, everyone!

160
00:11:44,826 --> 00:11:49,260
I shall display water flowing in such ways
that will leave you in disbelief!

161
00:11:49,652 --> 00:11:52,869
Ninja Art: Scrolling Technique!

162
00:11:52,869 --> 00:11:55,478
The Elephant's Bath
-

163
00:11:57,739 --> 00:11:59,217
Restoration!

164
00:12:06,739 --> 00:12:08,739
Massive, indeed!

165
00:12:11,217 --> 00:12:13,130
Water Heart,

166
00:12:13,217 --> 00:12:14,913
Fishman Jujutsu:

167
00:12:15,478 --> 00:12:19,956
Ocean Current Shoulder Throw!

168
00:12:28,565 --> 00:12:30,738
Fill every last bit of this castle!

169
00:12:32,826 --> 00:12:37,347
Be enough, waters of Zou,
to rescue us all!

170
00:12:52,130 --> 00:12:54,565
Let me down, guys!

171
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:59,651
You gotta let us do
somethin' for ya, Killer-san!

172
00:13:01,435 --> 00:13:02,739
Wow, hot!

173
00:13:04,739 --> 00:13:07,565
What do we do now?!
There's actually nowhere else to run!

174
00:13:09,478 --> 00:13:10,695
What's that?!

175
00:13:13,435 --> 00:13:15,521
That's one hell of a rumble...

176
00:13:20,696 --> 00:13:21,826
Water?!

177
00:13:23,565 --> 00:13:25,173
We're saved!

178
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:41,564
Make haste, Momonosuke-kun!

179
00:13:41,565 --> 00:13:45,434
Why must I?! Kaido yet lives!

180
00:13:45,435 --> 00:13:50,304
You must keep this island afloat
with your Flame Clouds!

181
00:13:50,304 --> 00:13:54,608
I, keep the island afloat?!
An impossible task!

182
00:13:54,608 --> 00:13:57,260
Kaido is surely close to his limits!

183
00:13:59,696 --> 00:14:02,435
His Flame Clouds will not
last much longer!

184
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,391
Heh?

185
00:14:04,391 --> 00:14:08,913
You must create Flame Clouds
to keep Onigashima in the skies!

186
00:14:08,957 --> 00:14:10,826
Ehhhh?!

187
00:14:10,826 --> 00:14:13,130
This was our only option
from the very start!

188
00:14:15,869 --> 00:14:19,521
As things stand,
Onigashima will plummet to the surface!

189
00:14:39,347 --> 00:14:43,521
You can do it, Momonosuke-kun!
Create Flame Clouds!

190
00:14:53,130 --> 00:14:55,434
Momonosuke-kun!
Just out with the Flame Clouds!

191
00:14:55,435 --> 00:14:57,652
'Tis easier said than done...

192
00:15:01,391 --> 00:15:02,782
I cannot do it!

193
00:15:02,782 --> 00:15:05,043
They will not come out!

194
00:15:05,043 --> 00:15:07,043
I cannot do it!

195
00:15:17,304 --> 00:15:18,521
Momonosuke

196
00:15:19,130 --> 00:15:21,304
Go with Kin'emon
and the others.

197
00:15:22,086 --> 00:15:24,956
You are to leap
twenty years into the future,

198
00:15:25,304 --> 00:15:28,130
and return the Kozuki Clan
to greatness!

199
00:15:28,913 --> 00:15:30,826
I cannot do it!

200
00:15:39,217 --> 00:15:42,869
Then why will you and Hiyori
not come with us?!

201
00:15:44,739 --> 00:15:46,521
Momonosuke-sama!

202
00:15:46,521 --> 00:15:48,695
Your mother's suffering is
greater than yours!

203
00:15:54,435 --> 00:15:56,695
This is the land of samurai,

204
00:15:56,696 --> 00:15:59,348
where shame alone could end your life!

205
00:15:59,739 --> 00:16:04,609
For a man to complain
after a woman has set her resolve...

206
00:16:05,435 --> 00:16:07,869
...is mortal shame!

207
00:16:08,521 --> 00:16:11,565
I am but a child...!

208
00:16:11,565 --> 00:16:14,869
With all due respect,
as Oden-sama is no longer with us,

209
00:16:14,869 --> 00:16:16,956
you are no longer an ordinary child!

210
00:16:16,957 --> 00:16:20,261
You are the son of a great samurai!

211
00:16:21,347 --> 00:16:24,782
And one day, you will lead our country!

212
00:16:28,435 --> 00:16:30,565
If you would allow me to be so forward...!

213
00:16:30,565 --> 00:16:35,217
Will you permit us
one more chance to fight?!

214
00:16:35,217 --> 00:16:38,086
If I am going to burn to death regardless,

215
00:16:38,086 --> 00:16:43,043
then I would die wielding my blade
in the name of my lord!

216
00:16:45,652 --> 00:16:50,478
Prithee would you give us
the chance to die as samurai?!

217
00:17:03,043 --> 00:17:04,477
Momonosuke!

218
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,696
Mother...

219
00:17:26,608 --> 00:17:28,565
Mother...

220
00:17:30,086 --> 00:17:33,303
I shall go!

221
00:17:35,217 --> 00:17:36,217
Aye...

222
00:17:36,957 --> 00:17:39,435
However you can, live...!

223
00:17:47,696 --> 00:17:50,174
I am too ashamed to face Mother!

224
00:17:51,391 --> 00:17:55,000
I am no longer some ordinary child!

225
00:17:55,478 --> 00:17:59,435
I am the man that will be
Shogun of this land!

226
00:17:59,869 --> 00:18:00,739
Mm!

227
00:18:01,347 --> 00:18:03,564
I will save our country!

228
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:06,434
Halt, Onigashima!

229
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,086
Wait, not that way!

230
00:18:11,086 --> 00:18:13,999
Not that way!
Not toward the capital!

231
00:18:22,130 --> 00:18:25,391
Gum-Gum...

232
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,435
Lightning!

233
00:18:34,478 --> 00:18:38,130
You're tellin' me you can grab lightning?!
Whatta load of bull!

234
00:18:38,826 --> 00:18:39,695
Wha?!

235
00:18:54,608 --> 00:18:56,304
Seriously, his power is bull...

236
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,478
Gum-Gum

237
00:19:06,739 --> 00:19:08,043
Why, ya little jerk!

238
00:20:28,826 --> 00:20:30,521
You can play around...

239
00:20:30,565 --> 00:20:30,912
Huh?

240
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,435
...all you want!

241
00:20:33,478 --> 00:20:34,782
But...

242
00:20:42,652 --> 00:20:47,043
A Devil Fruit power
will never conquer the world!

243
00:21:00,608 --> 00:21:03,260
Amazing, how things work.

244
00:21:04,739 --> 00:21:08,913
Just like how Roger
never ate a Devil Fruit...

245
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,957
Only Haki...

246
00:21:12,304 --> 00:21:14,912
...can transcend all!

247
00:21:18,174 --> 00:21:20,130
Destroyer of Death...

248
00:21:21,957 --> 00:21:23,391
...Thunder...

249
00:21:23,869 --> 00:21:25,782
...Bagua!

250
00:21:57,565 --> 00:21:59,695
We send to those
that have passed on...

251
00:21:59,696 --> 00:22:01,782
Set sail!

252
00:22:01,782 --> 00:22:03,652
Release your sky lantern boats!

253
00:22:03,652 --> 00:22:05,086
Steady as she goes!

254
00:22:05,086 --> 00:22:07,651
Steady as she goes!
Steady as she goes!

255
00:22:08,347 --> 00:22:10,564
The festival's end draws near...

256
00:22:10,565 --> 00:22:13,608
Tomorrow, we return to
laboring as slaves...

257
00:22:17,826 --> 00:22:21,608
I hope I can live to see another year...

258
00:22:29,652 --> 00:22:31,826
Steady as she goes!

259
00:22:32,217 --> 00:22:36,695
Reach my Daddy!

260
00:22:48,652 --> 00:22:50,130
What the?!

261
00:22:53,217 --> 00:22:55,347
The hell're you tryin'
to do to me?!

262
00:22:56,130 --> 00:22:57,347
Dammit, leggo!

263
00:22:57,347 --> 00:23:00,043
All you're doin' is
giving away your location!

264
00:23:02,739 --> 00:23:04,087
Dragon Twister...

265
00:23:04,957 --> 00:23:06,913
Demolition Breath!

266
00:23:08,869 --> 00:23:12,956
Bet you're still wide open to
cutting attacks!

267
00:23:17,869 --> 00:23:19,782
Get down here,

268
00:23:19,782 --> 00:23:22,565
Straw Hat!

269
00:23:47,217 --> 00:23:49,956
Hey, it came out!

270
00:23:49,957 --> 00:23:54,174
Some kind of tremor
pulled the Sea Prism Stone nail out!

271
00:24:03,869 --> 00:24:05,391
Damn you...

272
00:24:05,478 --> 00:24:08,130
At least I can take you down with me!

273
00:24:09,043 --> 00:24:12,521
Are you watching, Oden?!

274
00:24:14,478 --> 00:24:16,739
Your daughter...

275
00:24:19,217 --> 00:24:21,652
...dies with me!

276
00:24:27,652 --> 00:24:29,435
Kingpin Hyogoro!

277
00:24:29,435 --> 00:24:31,782
I heard Onigashima's plummeting!

278
00:24:33,478 --> 00:24:36,304
That means he's cornered Kaido...

279
00:24:36,304 --> 00:24:40,217
Tell me, men!
Which would you rather?

280
00:24:40,217 --> 00:24:43,521
If the Straw Hat Man takes Kaido down,

281
00:24:43,521 --> 00:24:45,738
we fall, and we die.

282
00:24:48,217 --> 00:24:51,043
If we survive,

283
00:24:51,957 --> 00:24:54,348
it means Kaido wins!

284
00:24:57,043 --> 00:24:59,651
Come on, the choice is simple!

285
00:24:59,652 --> 00:25:02,174
I have a kid in Hakumai.

286
00:25:02,174 --> 00:25:04,521
I have a wife in Ringo!

287
00:25:04,521 --> 00:25:08,565
If Kaido goes down,
our families live happily ever after!

288
00:25:08,565 --> 00:25:12,869
Wouldn't that be something?
Hell of a country ours would be then!

289
00:25:12,869 --> 00:25:17,826
Have you damn samurai lost your minds?!
That'd mean you all die!

290
00:25:17,826 --> 00:25:20,043
That's just as well, isn't it?

291
00:25:21,782 --> 00:25:23,565
Straw Hat-san!

292
00:25:23,565 --> 00:25:27,912
Beat Kaido back to where he belongs!

293
00:25:43,086 --> 00:25:45,564
I don't wanna die!
I don't wanna die!

294
00:25:45,565 --> 00:25:46,912
Ow, hot, ow!

295
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:49,957
don't wanna diffie!

296
00:25:52,478 --> 00:25:55,869
I'm gonna survive no matter what!

297
00:25:55,869 --> 00:25:57,521
You're the best!

298
00:26:06,043 --> 00:26:06,782
Water?!

299
00:26:09,086 --> 00:26:10,651
Kiku, Kin'emon!

300
00:26:10,739 --> 00:26:14,435
I'm not gonna give up!

301
00:26:24,608 --> 00:26:27,912
Halt, Onigashima!

302
00:26:27,913 --> 00:26:31,000
Heeey! Momo!

303
00:26:40,304 --> 00:26:43,130
I'm finishing this, right here!

304
00:26:43,957 --> 00:26:47,783
Onigashima's in my way!
Move it!

305
00:26:52,304 --> 00:26:54,130
Incredible...

306
00:26:54,565 --> 00:26:57,347
It is as if he intends to punch
straight through Onigashima...

307
00:26:57,347 --> 00:26:57,999
Stop!

308
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:58,435
Uwhoh!

309
00:26:58,435 --> 00:27:00,782
Wait, Luffy!
I still cannot...!

310
00:27:00,782 --> 00:27:02,086
Momo!

311
00:27:07,043 --> 00:27:09,956
I trust ya!

312
00:27:19,652 --> 00:27:24,782
OUTWITTED

313
00:27:44,565 --> 00:27:47,260
"Time's up"

314
00:27:48,608 --> 00:27:51,999
Someone said again, with a laugh

315
00:27:52,521 --> 00:27:56,999
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

316
00:27:57,739 --> 00:27:58,739
...is over

317
00:28:00,521 --> 00:28:03,869
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

318
00:28:04,086 --> 00:28:07,782
Let your heart beat out

319
00:28:08,782 --> 00:28:12,043
and things will change (We can see it soon)

320
00:28:12,130 --> 00:28:16,347
Grow strong, you have time

321
00:28:16,391 --> 00:28:17,217
Lift up that dream

322
00:28:17,304 --> 00:28:24,217
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

323
00:28:24,347 --> 00:28:28,347
We were so free in our younger days

324
00:28:28,478 --> 00:28:31,739
What a dumb dream

325
00:28:31,782 --> 00:28:32,869
...to live

326
00:28:33,043 --> 00:28:36,869
Shining a light on uncharted ways

327
00:28:36,913 --> 00:28:41,000
Get on our feet and try

328
00:28:41,043 --> 00:28:44,869
Let's see the ends of the world together

329
00:28:44,913 --> 00:28:54,044
Together, we can go and fly